## WORKFLOW

1. Analyze full requirements and cmopare with rust codebase ( don not make assumptions always check the rust source code to confirm the requiremnts for a swift feature)
2. Complete all dependencies first
3. Implement complete feature 
4. Double check the rust code to make sure the swift implementation aligns 100% with rust
5. Test with real implementations
6. Code review for compliance

